Learner -> Path: choose goal
Path -> Tech: follow roadmap
Tech -> Tutorials: learn in order
Tutorials -> Labs: practise
Labs -> Projects: build
Projects -> Capstone: prove skills
Capstone -> Ready: interview + certs
